Refactor `retry.go` to extract the repeated `500 * time.Millisecond` literal into a package constant named `defaultBackoff` and use `defaultBackoff` in both `InitialDelay` and `NextDelay`. Preserve package `retry` and imports.

```go
package retry

import "time"

func InitialDelay() time.Duration {
	return 500 * time.Millisecond
}

func NextDelay(attempt int) time.Duration {
	if attempt <= 0 {
		return 500 * time.Millisecond
	}
	return time.Duration(attempt) * 500 * time.Millisecond
}
